 "description": "Daily snow / ground / cloud / no-data classification of SW Montana from Sentinel-2 Collection 1 L2A (NDSI >= 0.4 or SCL snow, with the SCL cloud mask), on a 0.0003 degree grid. Method: https://line.itogeospatial.com/snow/methods.html",
 "license": "other",
